<title>USA: Campbell gets 13.53 mln shrs tendered.</title>
<headline>Campbell gets 13.53 mln shrs tendered.</headline>
<dateline>CAMDEN, N.J. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Campbell Soup Co said Friday that 13,528,975 shares were tendered according to preliminary results of its Dutch auction bid, which expired Thursday, October 10.</p>
<p>Campbell said it would buy all shares tendered at $80 per share.</p>
<p>Campbell said the shares it expects to buy are about 5.5 percent of its estimated 247 million shares outstanding. The company expects to have about 234 million shares outstanding after the buy.</p>
</text>
